        "data": {
          "comment": "# Draft Answers for an FAQ\n\nWrites short FAQ answers for a list of questions, each one paragraph under 60 words. The answers are short enough to paste into a help centre without editing.\n\n**How it works:** \"Input\" takes the questions as text. \"Agent\" follows a system prompt that asks for direct answers with no marketing language, in the order given. \"Output\" shows the finished FAQ.\n\n**Try this:** Paste five real support questions into \"Input\", pick a model on \"Agent\", and change the word limit in its system prompt if your help centre allows longer answers."
        },
